    "On [Garmin Connect](https://connect.garmin.com/app/activities), open an activity, click the gear icon and choose Export Original. Garmin Connect on iPhone can't export files." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Öffne auf [Garmin Connect](https://connect.garmin.com/app/activities) eine Aktivität, klicke auf das Zahnradsymbol und wähle „Original exportieren“. Garmin Connect auf dem iPhone kann keine Dateien exportieren."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En [Garmin Connect](https://connect.garmin.com/app/activities), abre una actividad, haz clic en el icono del engranaje y elige Export Original. Garmin Connect en iPhone no puede exportar archivos."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Sur [Garmin Connect](https://connect.garmin.com/app/activities), ouvrez une activité, cliquez sur l’icône en forme d’engrenage et choisissez Exporter l’original. Garmin Connect sur iPhone ne peut pas exporter de fichiers."
          }
        },
        "hi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[Garmin Connect](https://connect.garmin.com/app/activities) पर कोई गतिविधि खोलें, गियर आइकन पर क्लिक करें और Export Original चुनें। iPhone पर Garmin Connect फ़ाइलें एक्सपोर्ट नहीं कर सकता।"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Su [Garmin Connect](https://connect.garmin.com/app/activities) apri un’attività, clicca sull’icona a forma di ingranaggio e scegli Esporta originale. Garmin Connect su iPhone non può esportare file."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No [Garmin Connect](https://connect.garmin.com/app/activities), abra uma atividade, clique no ícone de engrenagem e escolha Exportar original. O Garmin Connect no iPhone não exporta arquivos."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "В [Garmin Connect](https://connect.garmin.com/app/activities) откройте активность, нажмите значок шестерёнки и выберите «Экспортировать оригинал». Garmin Connect на iPhone не умеет экспортировать файлы."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 [Garmin Connect](https://connect.garmin.com/app/activities) 上，打开一次活动，点击齿轮图标并选择“导出原始文件”。iPhone 版 Garmin Connect 无法导出文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
